They report a clean run against a local build of the stage 4 product at 775e7ad, not the isolated container, which I haven't run yet:
- **API suite:** 241 of 241 (the 210 stage 3 tests unchanged, plus 31 new covering refunds, corrections combined with refunds, batches and imports).
